The '''Recluse Fang''' grants a {{stat|damage|+150%}} bonus against {{mt|Arthropod}} mobs. Its {{AN|Webcutter}} ability allows it to clear webs left by the {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}}'s {{AN|Web of Lies}} ability.

